==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Kabuto Cat (Special Cat)|Kabuto Cat]], [[Kuwagata Cat (Special Cat)|Kuwagata Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N202 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N202]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*6 [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam the [[Kuwagata Cat (Special Cat)|Kuwagata Cat]] and [[Kabuto Cat (Special Cat)|Kabuto Cat]] to win. You don't even need [[Ancient Egg: N202 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N202]], just Kuwagata/Kabuto Cat solo this stage at lv.20.

